  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute reductions in maritime chokepoint accessibility spur states and commercial actors to deploy additional maritime‑domain awareness and redundant communications satellites to bypass disrupted surface links, increasing demand for smallsat deployments and near‑term launch activity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
