  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved accessibility and throughput at major maritime chokepoints lowers shipment risk and lead times for critical semiconductor inputs and equipment, making planned overseas fab buildouts and supply-dependent expansions more viable and increasing installed advanced-chip capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
