  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp increases in marine and energy insurance premiums and reductions in coverage availability for Middle East routes push Western partners to establish pooled underwriting, common risk-sharing mechanisms and joint logistics protocols, which increase institutional integration capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">middle_east_energy</data>
