  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">New and expanded export controls and secondary-sanctions regimes raise underwriters' legal and loss exposures for shipments touching sanctioned parties or using restricted technology, prompting insurers to withdraw coverage or raise premiums for Middle East energy cargoes and terminals.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_energy</data>
