  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved institutional integration capacity streamlines export licensing, joint procurement and cross‑border logistics, which directly speeds up and increases the volume of weapons, ammunition and equipment deliveries into the Ukraine conflict zone.</data>
