  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved institutional integration enables coordinated procurement, consolidated contracts and shared production lines among partners, rapidly scaling manufacture and delivery rates of space‑relevant defense hardware.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">western_alliance_realign</data>
